+"L177","2026-10-30 04:22 UTC","decision","The screen's intervention chosen under the overnight authorisation: critic_blind_tail3 (the tail_3 angle hidden from the value network only)","adopted","decision","Chosen by the session under the maintainer's 00:45 UTC authorisation (L169): critic_blind_tail3, the normalised observation 6 (the tail_3 angle) set to 0 before the value network only, the actor untouched. Design: 8 continuations (4 control, 4 critic_blind_tail3) from s42 1,048,576 to 2,490,368.","[measured, RUNLOG l772] Basis: the verified probe puts a policy-gradient pull on tail_3 from s42's onset (1.31M) with the critic's slope on the tail angle positive, and supports a critic-bootstrap source from 2.10M; whether the critic drives the onset is unresolved, which is what this arm tests directly. Not chosen: gae_lambda_1 (changes every actuator's advantages) and frozen_obs_norm (the normaliser was shown to oppose the loop). The scaffold had built all four arms behind flags (RUNLOG l770, l774).","stance_2026_10/critic_blind_results/run_log.txt l11, l13, l15 (RUNLOG l770, l772, l774) ; stance_2026_10/bias_screen/NOTES.txt","N10 (update of 2026-10-30; RUNLOG l772)","§9.1; §9.4",""
+"L178","2026-10-30 03:45-06:00 UTC","screen","BS design, criteria, review and pin: 4 control + 4 critic_blind_tail3 continuations from s42's 1,048,576 state, informative only if the control median rises by at least 0.10","adopted","decision","The scaffold (BS NOTES.txt): a verified code copy (digest 331fe8fc..., 1,406 files), run_bs.py, run_waves_bs.sh (4 at a time at nice 10, outcome-blind), read_bs.py, bs_hooks.py (the four arms) and bs_common.py; V1 start reproduction, V2 no-update runs proving each arm in force and control unchanged, V3 reader reproduction; 72 tests. The criteria (writer, independent reviewer, fixer): the primary is the on-policy tail_3 command (the probe's rollout_mu, action 14) over the last 8 updates before E = 2,490,368 (175 updates); an exact one-sided unpaired permutation test (blind lower), alpha 0.05, minimum p 1/70; informative only if the control median rises by at least 0.10 from S (-0.0316); lines NOT INFORMATIVE / REDUCED / NO REDUCTION DETECTED; paired seeds 2101-2131.","[measured, RUNLOG l774-l776, l781] Criteria v2 (sha256 9c490cc6...) after an independent review of v1 (9 findings, 0 blocking, all fixed); APPROVED (0444, sha256 7bf25afd..., written 06:00:05 UTC) pins the criteria, SCREEN.json a4eca4dc..., the code digest and six tools; preflight passed; launched at 06:00:19 UTC, 4 at a time at nice 10, with 2.67 GB free; outcome-blind. The fixed version was not re-reviewed (the process check's P2), and APPROVED's full text reached the run log on the line after the check's (P1).","stance_2026_10/bias_screen/criteria.txt ; stance_2026_10/bias_screen/APPROVED ; stance_2026_10/bias_screen/NOTES.txt ; stance_2026_10/bias_screen/NOTES_criteria.txt ; stance_2026_10/bias_screen/review/NOTES.txt ; stance_2026_10/bias_screen/review/FIXES.txt ; stance_2026_10/critic_blind_results/run_log.txt l15-l17, l22 (RUNLOG l774-l776, l781)","N11 (update of 2026-10-30; BS, RUNLOG l774-l776)","§9.1; §9.4",""
